        "hotel": {
            "name": "Villa Venecia Hotel Boutique Gourmet",
            "strapline": "LUXURY BEACHFRONT HOTEL WITH ROOFTOP SPA",
            "description": "<p>From its range of five-star facilities to its spectacular beachfront location in the Old Town of Benidorm, the Villa Venecia Hotel Boutique Hotel is a place where holiday memories are made. Expect a few days of unbridled luxury if you choose to stay here.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Bring your swimwear as this elegant hotel&rsquo;s is just a few minutes&rsquo; stroll from the Blue-Flag beauty of Mal Pas Beach, famous for its golden sands and crystal-clear waters. Quieter and less crowded than more well-known Benidorm beaches, it&rsquo;s the perfect place to laze on a sun lounger and take in the picturesque surroundings without being disturbed by noisier holidaymakers.</p>\n<p>Back at the hotel, meanwhile, a day of pampering awaits at the hotel spa. Situated on the rooftop for panoramic views of the Mediterranean Sea, troubles will soon melt away as you immerse yourself in the indoor pool and its cascading water jets. There&rsquo;s an extensive range of beauty treatments, too, as well as a gym featuring state-of-the-art equipment, so you won&rsquo;t ever have to miss a workout.</p>\n<p>Food and drink&rsquo;s taken very seriously around here. The hotel restaurant &ndash; LLum del Mar &ndash; tantalises tastebuds with a mouth-watering menu of gastronomic delights inspired by Mediterranean cuisine. And for a more chilled out affair, head to the Sunset Terrace to enjoy a cocktail and light bite, all served to a backdrop of spectacular sea views. There&rsquo;s a second gourmet restaurant, too, featuring more sweeping sea views and regular live music to accompany your meal.</p>\n<p>Your entire holiday could be spent at the hotel, but you also have the delights of Benidorm&rsquo;s old town to explore at your own pace. Take your pick from a plethora of bar, restaurants, and nightclubs, all designed to have you partying well into the wee hours of the evening.</p>\n<div>Planning a festive escape? Special themed events take place here around Christmas time. Think exclusive activities, live entertainment shows, parties, competitions and themed food and drink offerings that are only available during this period. Specific dates may vary year-on-year, so if this is of interest to you, it's always worth double checking beforehand to ensure the timing of your trip lines up to make the most of the festive cheer.&nbsp;</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
